    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h1>Join Stuff Enuff Newsletter</h1><p><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989970/extras/051fb2e0c161c5f25ac014d6b6208b17.avif?t=1728934740\" /></div></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989970/extras/96077fd8f50b6cc4896626fd5f0c3cb4.poster.avif?t=1728934740\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989970/extras/96077fd8f50b6cc4896626fd5f0c3cb4.webm?t=1728934740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989970/extras/96077fd8f50b6cc4896626fd5f0c3cb4.mp4?t=1728934740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Introducing Stuff Enuff, an engaging party game meticulously crafted with the competitive gaming community in focus. Departing from the unpredictability often associated with conventional party games, our aim is to place emphasis on skill and strategy, ensuring that the most adept players emerge victorious, rather than leaving outcomes to chance. Assume the role of one of eight charismatic Stuffed Animals and engage in spirited competition with your companions. The pinnacle of proficiency will undoubtedly prevail, providing ample opportunity for light-hearted banter among participants.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989970/extras/f19eda500d22305f299b1e5ccc21ff84.poster.avif?t=1728934740\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989970/extras/f19eda500d22305f299b1e5ccc21ff84.webm?t=1728934740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989970/extras/f19eda500d22305f299b1e5ccc21ff84.mp4?t=1728934740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Stuff Enuff is tailored for optimal 4-player participation, offering a diverse range of gameplay modes including Free-For-All, 3v1, and Tag Team challenges. With a plethora of captivating mini-games and an array of dynamic gameboards, an abundance of enjoyment and healthy rivalry is guaranteed. Whether pitting wits against friends, family, or even adversaries, assert your dominance and declare, &quot;I am Stuff Enuff!&quot;.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989970/extras/6d5642faaafc5730f6d20fac6ebe111e.poster.avif?t=1728934740\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989970/extras/6d5642faaafc5730f6d20fac6ebe111e.webm?t=1728934740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989970/extras/6d5642faaafc5730f6d20fac6ebe111e.mp4?t=1728934740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989970/extras/96077fd8f50b6cc4896626fd5f0c3cb4.poster.avif?t=1728934740\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989970/extras/96077fd8f50b6cc4896626fd5f0c3cb4.webm?t=1728934740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989970/extras/96077fd8f50b6cc4896626fd5f0c3cb4.mp4?t=1728934740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Introducing Stuff Enuff, an engaging party game meticulously crafted with the competitive gaming community in focus. Departing from the unpredictability often associated with conventional party games, our aim is to place emphasis on skill and strategy, ensuring that the most adept players emerge victorious, rather than leaving outcomes to chance. Assume the role of one of eight charismatic Stuffed Animals and engage in spirited competition with your companions. The pinnacle of proficiency will undoubtedly prevail, providing ample opportunity for light-hearted banter among participants.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989970/extras/f19eda500d22305f299b1e5ccc21ff84.poster.avif?t=1728934740\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989970/extras/f19eda500d22305f299b1e5ccc21ff84.webm?t=1728934740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989970/extras/f19eda500d22305f299b1e5ccc21ff84.mp4?t=1728934740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Stuff Enuff is tailored for optimal 4-player participation, offering a diverse range of gameplay modes including Free-For-All, 3v1, and Tag Team challenges. With a plethora of captivating mini-games and an array of dynamic gameboards, an abundance of enjoyment and healthy rivalry is guaranteed. Whether pitting wits against friends, family, or even adversaries, assert your dominance and declare, &quot;I am Stuff Enuff!&quot;.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989970/extras/6d5642faaafc5730f6d20fac6ebe111e.poster.avif?t=1728934740\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989970/extras/6d5642faaafc5730f6d20fac6ebe111e.webm?t=1728934740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989970/extras/6d5642faaafc5730f6d20fac6ebe111e.mp4?t=1728934740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
